                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "jc5og",
                  "name": "Spec 安全区",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#2F6BFF0A",
                  "cornerRadius": 12,
                  "stroke": "#2F6BFF33",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 6,
                  "padding": [
                    14,
                    16
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "KgjDM",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#111318",
                      "content": "安全区适配",
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o4nxd",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#4B5060",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 挂在 App 根部、所有导航之上：书架、笔记、设置、阅读页都显示在同一位置，切页面不重建、不重播动画。和接收页互斥：进入接收页时胶囊收起，离开接收页时出现，接收结束后消失",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "SutG1",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#4B5060",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 胶囊是固定悬浮层，不占布局：顶边 = safeAreaInsets.top + 4（灵动岛机型约 59–62，刘海机型 47，SE 20），图中蓝色区域是状态栏安全区",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "jo7lb",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#4B5060",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 不进状态栏，也不和灵动岛拼接：App 在前台时系统不显示 Live Activity，画在灵动岛位置会被遮住、和时间信号重叠",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "B8231k",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#4B5060",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 书架界面不下移，也不加 contentInset；列表上下滚动时胶囊位置不变，内容从胶囊下方滚过，胶囊靠毛玻璃和阴影和内容分开",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "J5M2Y",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "#4B5060",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 水平居中，左右至少留 safeAreaInsets.left / right + 20",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
